{"unit_id":"GHJIVHIDD__dsh-plugin-repoflow#feature-status","repo":"GHJIVHIDD/dsh-plugin-repoflow","commit":"2859e2d297583bdbaed32c1e5779ed9889e3ce84","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"RepoFlow 的功能「仓库状态」：输入本地目录后，可查看是否为 Git 仓库、当前分支、ahead/behind、文件变更分类、远程地址、最近提交和提交图。通过设置页刷新或调用 git_status 工具获取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:320-389","lib/index.js:942-1089","lib/client.js:146-159","lib/client.js:213-226"]}
{"unit_id":"GHJIVHIDD__dsh-plugin-repoflow#feature-commit","repo":"GHJIVHIDD/dsh-plugin-repoflow","commit":"2859e2d297583bdbaed32c1e5779ed9889e3ce84","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"RepoFlow 的功能「提交更改」：用户输入本地仓库路径和提交说明后，插件暂存全部改动并创建 Git 提交；没有变更时返回空提交提示。可从设置页按钮或 git_commit 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:320-389","lib/index.js:942-1089","lib/client.js:146-159","lib/client.js:213-226"]}
{"unit_id":"GHJIVHIDD__dsh-plugin-repoflow#feature-github","repo":"GHJIVHIDD/dsh-plugin-repoflow","commit":"2859e2d297583bdbaed32c1e5779ed9889e3ce84","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"RepoFlow 的功能「创建并推送 GitHub 仓库」：为本地目录创建或关联远程 GitHub 仓库，设置远程地址并推送当前分支；可提供仓库名、描述和可见性，通过页面操作或 git_create_repo 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:320-389","lib/index.js:942-1089","lib/client.js:146-159","lib/client.js:213-226"]}
